<title>JAPAN: NEC's shares hit 1997 high, trade heavy.</title>
<headline>NEC's shares hit 1997 high, trade heavy.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of NEC Corp hit their highest level for the calendar year on Thursday, helped by the dollar's continued surge against the yen, traders said.</p>
<p>NEC's shares were up 40 yen at 1,540 at 0131 GMT, after earlier rising to a high of 1,550 yen.</p>
<p>Its turnover of 3.993 million topped the most active list on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
